            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[0]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【审校范围（非原文）4】保留各块原有tableContext、sourceSegments和标记；本次给出的正文块tableContext均为null，原有segments的marks均为空。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "limited-next3-276-5",
