            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[0]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "免责声明：  以下文章的著作权等各种权利归原作者所有，翻译 By SeventhTG（XD）。如果你喜欢本文并有幸让你产生了转载的想法，请注明原作者、原文地址以及译者，谢谢。 原文地址： http://beginners.biz/osihiki/osihiki03.html  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b2",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0002"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[1]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "那么，前一节我列举了攻守判断的要素"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b3",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0003"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[2]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "我们来看看实际的几个是应该攻，还是应该守的例子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b4",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0004"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[3]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "例1："
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b5",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0005"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[4]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b5",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0005"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[4]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "例1",
            "imageSha256": "633fc44741c600056f9789a52b8323120132af995ba69adab7b3e43194279e52",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "4f38c87492c98f76c294f14e6139c7f35df374d97c8050df73cdb6fc15b0864c"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "中央：东2局0本场。白色立直棒右侧标示1根；下方“宝牌”标签右侧为9p。\n座位及点数：下方东家24000，右侧南家25000，上方西家27000，左侧北家23000。\n下方手牌，按屏幕从左至右：3m 4m 5m 7m 8m 9p 9p 3s 4s 6s 7s 8s 6z。右侧隔开的一张：6m。\n下方弃牌，按屏幕从左至右：1p 1s 1z 6p 7s 2m。\n上方弃牌，按屏幕从左至右：6s（相对上家正常牌向横置）5z 6p 9m 7z 1z。除横置的6s外，牌面相对屏幕倒置。\n左侧弃牌，按屏幕从上至下：1m 9m 7z [风牌未辨明] [风牌未辨明] 3p。牌面相对屏幕顺时针旋转90°。\n右侧弃牌，按屏幕从上至下：9s [风牌未辨明] 5z 7z [风牌未辨明] 9m。牌面相对屏幕逆时针旋转90°。\n上方、左侧、右侧各有13张背面朝上的手牌。未见副露。\n原图未显示的信息：左侧弃牌从上至下第4张的风牌牌码未辨明。；左侧弃牌从上至下第5张的风牌牌码未辨明。；右侧弃牌从上至下第2张的风牌牌码未辨明。；右侧弃牌从上至下第5张的风牌牌码未辨明。"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b6",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0006"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[6]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "看到这个牌的瞬间就有一种想扔棒子的冲动，一上来我就给了一个比较极端的例子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b7",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0007"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[7]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【和牌的容易度】好型两面听牌"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b8",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0008"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[8]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【打点】立直的话有11600点"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b9",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0009"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[9]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【牌的危险度】发并不是特别危险的一张牌"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b10",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0010"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[10]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【弃和成功率】安全牌只有6索"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b11",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0011"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[11]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "不管怎么看，这牌没有理由不对日。应该毫不犹豫地扔棒子对攻。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b12",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0012"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[12]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b13",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0013"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[13]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "例2："
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b14",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0014"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[14]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b14",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0014"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[14]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "例2：东4局，北家手牌与四家弃牌。",
            "imageSha256": "35938b3e17117bfcdefe24b239370902ebbd9493ab6a48b9102b7389936f01a9",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "2e1922c12278d34420f83670d380962821a6ab55a328925892ee308db069e8a3"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "中央：东4局0本场。白色立直棒右侧标示1根；下方“宝牌”标签右侧为3z。\n座位及点数：下方北家33500，右侧东家25500，上方南家24500，左侧西家15500。\n下方手牌，按屏幕从左至右：1m 1m 2p 2p 3p 7p 9p 5s 5s（赤）6s 7s 8s 9s。右侧隔开的一张：2s。\n下方弃牌：第一行从左至右为6z 3m 8m 1s 5z 9m；第二行在第一行左端下方，从左至右为1s 2s。\n上方弃牌：靠中央一行按屏幕从左至右为2m 2p 1z 9s 3m 3s；外侧一行位于其右端上方，从左至右为9p 5z 4z。牌面均相对屏幕倒置。\n左侧弃牌：靠中央一列按屏幕从上至下为4z 1z 8s 5z 9s 1z；外侧一列从上至下为4m 4s 9m。外侧9m相对左家正常牌向横置，屏幕上呈直立；其余牌面相对屏幕顺时针旋转90°。\n右侧弃牌：靠中央一列按屏幕从上至下为9p 8m 7p 3m 6z 4z；外侧一列与内列后三张对齐，从上至下为1m 2z 9s。牌面均相对屏幕逆时针旋转90°。\n上方、左侧、右侧各有13张背面朝上的手牌。未见副露。"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b15",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0015"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[16]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "接下来是一个明显该弃和的例子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b16",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0016"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[17]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【和牌的容易度】两向听而且还有愚型，鸣牌也没什么帮助，要和出概率很低。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b17",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0017"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[18]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【打点】立直宝牌1，运气好的可能有平和"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b18",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0018"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[19]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【牌的危险度】最没用的这张2索危险度还是比较高"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b19",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0019"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[20]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【弃和成功率】8、9索两种现物，而且1万的安全度比较高"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b20",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0020"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[21]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "还有就是，自己是TOP，而立直的人是四位。这些条件结合起来看，没有必要去进攻。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b21",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0021"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[22]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "为了以防别人追立，先从8索开始切，共同的安全牌9索留到以后的巡目再切。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b22",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0022"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[23]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "以上是一些很容易明白的例子，所以还没什么难度。实际上进攻和防守的因素混合在一起的比较难以判断的情况比较多。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b23",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0023"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[24]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "------------------------------------------------------------------------------------"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b24",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0024"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[25]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "例3："
        },
        {
          "type": "figure",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b25",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0025"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/div[26]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
            ]
          },
          "figure": {
            "figureId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b25",
            "unitId": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-argument",
            "page": null,
            "locator": {
              "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
              "sourceBlockIds": [
                "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0025"
              ],
              "domPaths": [
                "main/div[26]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]/div[0]"
              ]
            },
            "caption": "例3：南1局，北家手牌、四家弃牌与西家副露。",
            "imageSha256": "b6ae15a171ba9adc826591f4cbc5e06738f218214a5ab7db49c8d76859b734f9",
            "imageProvenance": {
              "kind": "derived-source-assets",
              "method": "source-order-horizontal-RGBA-bottom-aligned-no-gap",
              "sourceAssetSha256s": [
                "6c9edd4f497f984fb3696c165cfdc8386ea375fcd9d053543a842a63aec5de20"
              ]
            },
            "transcription": {
              "text": "中央：南1局0本场。白色立直棒右侧标示1根；下方“宝牌”标签右侧为5p。\n座位及点数：下方北家21100，右侧东家21000，上方南家32000，左侧西家25000。\n下方手牌，按屏幕从左至右：2m 3m 5m 7m 7m 5p 5p 6p 7p 5s 7s 8s 9s。右侧隔开的一张：6m。\n下方弃牌：第一行从左至右为1s 1p 7z 2z 5z 2p；第二行位于第一行左端下方，从左至右为1z 1s 8s。\n上方弃牌：靠中央一行按屏幕从左至右为1z 8p 9s 8m 3z 2m；外侧一行位于其右端上方，从左至右为6p（相对上家正常牌向横置）7z 2z。除横置6p外，牌面均相对屏幕倒置。\n左侧弃牌：靠中央一列按屏幕从上至下为1z 7z 6z 3z 1p 8m；外侧一列从上至下为7s 5z 2m 8p。牌面均相对屏幕顺时针旋转90°。\n右侧弃牌：靠中央一列按屏幕从上至下为1s 3s 2z 6z 5z 3z；外侧一列与内列后四张对齐，从上至下为9p 1z 1m 4m。牌面均相对屏幕逆时针旋转90°。\n左下角西家副露，按屏幕从上至下：4s 3s 5s（赤）。4s相对西家正常牌向横置，在屏幕上呈直立；3s与赤5s的牌面相对屏幕顺时针旋转90°。\n上方、右侧各有13张背面朝上的手牌；左侧有10张背面朝上的手牌。"
            },
            "requiresImageForFullExample": false
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b26",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0026"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[28]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【和牌的容易度】一向听，进张不太多了"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b27",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0027"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[29]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【打点】门平宝牌1~3，足够了"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b28",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0028"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[30]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【牌的危险度】没有通过的筋牌比较多，7万、5索都很危险"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b29",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0029"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[31]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "【弃和成功率】现物两张、筋牌一张，估计能够弃和成功"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b30",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0030"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[32]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "除了基本的判断材料之外，南场的TOP立直，看来是想确定自己的领先优势。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b31",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0031"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[33]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "这样的状况下，为了减少自己的迷惑、冷静的进行攻守判断，有攻守判断的“脊柱”材料是非常重要的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b32",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0032"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[34]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "这个讲座里，我比较推荐以“自己的向听数”来进行判断。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b33",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0033"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[35]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "具体来说就是，“要与立直对攻，自己要先听牌了”是基本；“一向听的话，就可以攻一巡”，这么记就好了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b34",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0034"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[36]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "为什么一向听一下不能对攻呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b35",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0035"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[37]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "自己听牌之前是不会有获得点棒的机会的。即使对攻，也不能保证下一巡能够维持听牌，说不定危险牌还回来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b36",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0036"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[38]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "自己还没有听牌的时候切危险牌，只是给对手增加机会而已。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b37",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0037"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[39]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "宝牌2的一向听，听牌了的话，打点比较有优势。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b38",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0038"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[40]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "如同例3一样，那样的进张数要连续攻2次也是不利的。还是弃和比较好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b39",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0039"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[41]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "理论："
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b40",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0040"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[42]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "攻守判断以向听数做主线是比较主流的方式。听牌的话就攻，一向听的话攻一次，两向听以下弃和是基本。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b41",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0041"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[43]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "攻守判断想要模式化是非常困难的，所以下一节就不在打算再系统化了，而去考虑一下赤牌麻将中应该攻、还是该守的实例。"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "id": "79-bilibili-cn-cv1793434-b42",
          "page": null,
          "locator": {
            "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv1793434",
            "sourceBlockIds": [
              "79-bilibili-cn:cv1793434:b0042"
            ],
            "domPaths": [
              "main/p[44]"
            ]
          },
          "text": "（待续）"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
